Cell["What remains open", "Section",
 CellID->1541450781,ExpressionUUID->"5077c06e-c394-b43c-000c-da4bf6261f06"],

Cell["\<\
The bounds depend on the entire tail length. These statements do not cover \
every tail, and no proof is given that every tail has a vacuum-free suffix \
certificate. The period-two obstruction remains. No full Rule 30 Prize \
problem is solved, no limiting frequency is proved, and no computational \
lower bound is proved.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1657269721,ExpressionUUID->"07359582-e823-44a1-2eca-0cef89d62e8b"],

Cell["\<\
This addendum is separate from the earlier essay and does not certify that \
essay's entire five-tail proof or notebook. It adds a reusable corollary with \
its own complete source and local kernel evidence. Human authorship, notebook \
evaluation, and any eventual prize submission are separate remaining steps.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1140508347,ExpressionUUID->"7c239bd0-3ff5-3b18-25d0-129ab9818662"],

Cell["References", "Section",
 CellID->496109794,ExpressionUUID->"68c76573-72ce-0c1a-18fd-7d3d077b5760"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The preceding computational essay, ",
 StyleBox["Infinite exclusions and an arbitrary-tail reduction for Rule 30", 
  "TI"],
 ", supplied as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"Rule30", "-", "Computational", "-", 
   RowBox[{"Essay", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", "1", ")"}], ".", "md"}]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6184d2f2-049e-728e-17bb-cbbcad2b40d4"],
 "."
}], "Item",
 CellID->108435171,ExpressionUUID->"4fd967ef-5008-0b29-75e7-7ec961bd5673"],

Cell[TextData[{
 ButtonBox["Rule 30 Prize kit",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://github.com/WolframInstitute/Rule30PrizeKit"], None}],
 ", including ",
 Cell[BoxData["Rule30FiniteConfigs"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "19bb1c5e-57ab-6e36-4f58-9618625e351c"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["Rule30FiniteMaskedJen"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5c8dcc56-7aa9-964a-04b2-e6107f5dfc90"],
 ", and ",
 Cell[BoxData["Rule30FiniteBlackRuns"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "30baa1c8-66ad-75e0-6059-389213585fca"],
 "."
}], "Item",
 CellID->829388421,ExpressionUUID->"52535901-cb26-8b9c-0261-516aeed0d9e6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The earlier ",
 Cell[BoxData["Rule30WhitePulseResearch"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "323a4b1c-b138-a791-63da-6359c0b20dfb"],
 " and the new catalog modules in this fork's contribution branches. The \
result is a corollary of that white-pulse reduction."
}], "Item",
 CellID->203008389,ExpressionUUID->"7421cf44-a1ac-4319-1dde-e721d0592e63"],

